---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="About Dr. Susheel Tyagi | A Legacy of Medical Excellence"
  description="MBBS & MD from KGMU Lucknow, PG Diploma in Diabetes (Royal College of Physicians, UK), FACP, FICP, FIACM, FDIAI. 16+ years in internal medicine."
>
  <main class="flex-grow flex flex-col items-center w-full px-gutter max-w-[1280px] mx-auto pb-section-padding-desktop">

    <!-- =============== HERO =============== -->
    <section class="w-full pt-16 pb-12 md:pt-24 md:pb-20 flex flex-col items-center text-center">
      <p class="hero-line-1 text-label-md font-label-md text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">About Dr. Tyagi</p>
      <h1 class="hero-line-2 text-display-lg-mobile md:text-display-lg font-display-lg text-primary mb-6">A Legacy of Medical Excellence</h1>
      <p class="hero-line-3 text-body-lg font-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-3xl">
        With over 16 years of dedicated practice, Dr. Susheel Tyagi combines rigorous academic foundations with extensive clinical experience. A renowned internal medicine specialist with a particular focus on infectious diseases, diabetes, hypertension, obesity, and metabolic disorders — trusted by patients and peers alike.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- =============== EDUCATION + FELLOWSHIPS =============== -->
    <section class="w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 mb-section-padding-mobile md:mb-section-padding-desktop">
      <div class="reveal reveal-left col-span-1 md:col-span-5 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl ambient-shadow border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden flex flex-col">
        <img
          alt="Dr. Susheel Tyagi"
          class="w-full h-64 object-cover object-top"
          src="/assets/dr-tyagi.jpg"
          onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBRl6BzkOf6GFJrEzhQ-DJ6zUUPo7iWk-NrolisaGj7tzcjKfm5uynH_-3ByI34priLaOVyB9z16w9EYtywte5owHjo70JJa021Ff--YTKqzZcUasSgyW-zq-T61au-2g4Lt6T46F-Qkh5oG0h3T47aYiPnTp8A5s_GyCB2YsEkEPmDBBhXhTmATl-9HdnfVKTFGffivh1YH20NMc01by7Cjam2OO7PO2NCjkzYeAqnFddqcGtqAVgeDr2sDHrxwD0V4e8DM_T3_3A';"
        />
        <div class="p-8 flex-grow flex flex-col">
          <p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Education &amp; Training</p>
          <h2 class="text-headline-sm font-headline-sm text-primary mb-6">Academic Foundation</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-5">
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mr-3 mt-0.5 icon-fill">school</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-primary">MBBS &amp; MD (Medicine)</p>
                <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant">King George's Medical University (KGMU), Lucknow</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mr-3 mt-0.5 icon-fill">verified</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-primary">PG Diploma — Clinical Endocrinology &amp; Diabetes</p>
                <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Royal College of Physicians, United Kingdom</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mr-3 mt-0.5 icon-fill">workspace_premium</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-primary">Certificate Course in Diabetes</p>
                <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Diabetes Research Centre &amp; MV Hospital, Chennai</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mr-3 mt-0.5 icon-fill">monitor_weight</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-primary">SCOPE Certified — Obesity Prevention &amp; Management</p>
                <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Strategic Centre for Obesity Professional Education, Pune</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal reveal-right col-span-1 md:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-6">
        <div class="bg-primary rounded-xl p-8 flex-grow relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_right,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-secondary-fixed to-transparent"></div>
          <div class="relative z-10">
            <p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-secondary-fixed-dim uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Awards &amp; Accomplishments</p>
            <h2 class="text-headline-md font-headline-md text-on-primary mb-4">Prestigious Fellowships</h2>
            <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-primary/80 mb-8 max-w-xl">Recognised by esteemed medical institutions for outstanding contributions to internal medicine and clinical excellence.</p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <div class="badge-fellow bg-on-primary/10 rounded border border-on-primary/20 p-4 flex items-center group hover:bg-on-primary/20 transition-colors cursor-default">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary-fixed mr-3 text-3xl group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">military_tech</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-on-primary tracking-wider">FICP</p>
                  <p class="text-caption font-caption text-on-primary-container">Indian College of Physicians</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="badge-fellow bg-on-primary/10 rounded border border-on-primary/20 p-4 flex items-center group hover:bg-on-primary/20 transition-colors cursor-default">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary-fixed mr-3 text-3xl group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">military_tech</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-on-primary tracking-wider">FACP</p>
                  <p class="text-caption font-caption text-on-primary-container">American College of Physicians</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="badge-fellow bg-on-primary/10 rounded border border-on-primary/20 p-4 flex items-center group hover:bg-on-primary/20 transition-colors cursor-default">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary-fixed mr-3 text-3xl group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">military_tech</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-on-primary tracking-wider">FIACM</p>
                  <p class="text-caption font-caption text-on-primary-container">Indian Assoc. Clinical Medicine</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="badge-fellow bg-on-primary/10 rounded border border-on-primary/20 p-4 flex items-center group hover:bg-on-primary/20 transition-colors cursor-default">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary-fixed mr-3 text-3xl group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">military_tech</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-on-primary tracking-wider">FDIAI</p>
                  <p class="text-caption font-caption text-on-primary-container">Diabetes India</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-on-primary/15 flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary-fixed icon-fill">emoji_events</span>
              <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-primary"><span class="font-semibold">EDPA Championship Award</span> — East Delhi Physicians Association</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- =============== TIMELINE =============== -->
    <section class="w-full mb-section-padding-mobile md:mb-section-padding-desktop">
      <div class="text-center mb-12 reveal">
        <p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Work Experience</p>
        <h2 class="text-headline-md font-headline-md text-primary">Clinical Trajectory</h2>
        <div class="h-1 w-24 bg-secondary mx-auto mt-4"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto relative border-l-2 border-surface-dim pl-8 py-4 space-y-12">
        <div class="reveal relative">
          <div class="timeline-dot absolute -left-[41px] top-1 h-5 w-5 rounded-full bg-secondary border-4 border-background"></div>
          <div class="lift-card bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-lg ambient-shadow border border-outline-variant/30 border-t-2 border-t-secondary">
            <p class="text-caption font-caption text-secondary uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Current</p>
            <h3 class="text-headline-sm font-headline-sm text-primary">Senior Consultant Physician — MEDIIX Clinic</h3>
            <p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-on-surface-variant mb-2">Indirapuram, Ghaziabad</p>
            <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Leads internal medicine consultations with a specialty focus on diabetes, hypertension, obesity, and metabolic syndrome management.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal relative" data-delay="100">
          <div class="timeline-dot absolute -left-[41px] top-1 h-5 w-5 rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed-dim border-4 border-background"></div>
          <div class="lift-card bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-lg ambient-shadow border border-outline-variant/30">
            <h3 class="text-headline-sm font-headline-sm text-primary">Senior Consultant Physician — Avantika Hospital</h3>
            <p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-on-surface-variant mb-2">Indirapuram, Ghaziabad</p>
            <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Provided comprehensive internal medicine care with focus on metabolic disorders and lifestyle disease management.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal relative" data-delay="200">
          <div class="timeline-dot absolute -left-[41px] top-1 h-5 w-5 rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed-dim border-4 border-background"></div>
          <div class="lift-card bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-lg ambient-shadow border border-outline-variant/30">
            <h3 class="text-headline-sm font-headline-sm text-primary">Senior Consultant Physician — Flores Hospital</h3>
            <p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-on-surface-variant mb-2">Pratap Vihar, Ghaziabad</p>
            <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Established protocols for chronic disease management and provided specialised consultations across internal medicine.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal relative" data-delay="300">
          <div class="timeline-dot absolute -left-[41px] top-1 h-5 w-5 rounded-full bg-surface-dim border-4 border-background"></div>
          <div class="lift-card bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-lg ambient-shadow border border-outline-variant/30">
            <h3 class="text-headline-sm font-headline-sm text-primary">Senior Resident — NDMC Medical College &amp; Hindu Rao Hospital</h3>
            <p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-on-surface-variant mb-2">Delhi</p>
            <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Managed complex internal medicine cases at one of Delhi's largest multi-specialty hospitals.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal relative" data-delay="400">
          <div class="timeline-dot absolute -left-[41px] top-1 h-5 w-5 rounded-full bg-surface-dim border-4 border-background"></div>
          <div class="lift-card bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 rounded-lg ambient-shadow border border-outline-variant/30">
            <h3 class="text-headline-sm font-headline-sm text-primary">Senior Resident — MLN Medical College &amp; SRN Hospital</h3>
            <p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-on-surface-variant mb-2">Prayagraj</p>
            <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Trained in acute care, emergency medicine, and complex multi-system disorders within a high-volume tertiary care setting.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- =============== MEMBERSHIPS =============== -->
    <section class="w-full mb-section-padding-mobile md:mb-section-padding-desktop">
      <div class="text-center mb-12 reveal">
        <p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Professional Memberships</p>
        <h2 class="text-headline-md font-headline-md text-primary">Life Member of Leading Medical Bodies</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
        {[
          { code: 'API', full: 'Association of Physicians of India' },
          { code: 'ACP', full: 'American College of Physicians' },
          { code: 'RSSDI', full: 'Research Society for Diabetes in India' },
          { code: 'ADA', full: 'American Diabetes Association' },
          { code: 'AiAARO', full: 'All India Assoc. for Research in Obesity' },
          { code: 'IACM', full: 'Indian Assoc. of Clinical Medicine' },
          { code: 'UPDA', full: 'UP Diabetes Association' },
          { code: 'ISH', full: 'Indian Society of Hypertension' },
          { code: 'EDPA', full: 'East Delhi Physicians Association' },
          { code: 'IMA', full: 'Indian Medical Association' },
        ].map((m, i) => (
          <div
            class="reveal lift-card bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/30 rounded-xl p-5 text-center ambient-shadow"
            data-delay={(i % 5) * 100}
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-3xl mb-2">groups</span>
            <p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-primary">{m.code}</p>
            <p class="text-caption font-caption text-on-surface-variant mt-1">{m.full}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- =============== PUBLICATIONS =============== -->
    <section class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-12">
      <div class="text-center mb-8 reveal">
        <p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Publications &amp; Research</p>
        <h2 class="text-headline-md font-headline-md text-primary">Contributing to Medical Knowledge</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal lift-card bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl p-8 border border-outline-variant/30 ambient-shadow flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start gap-6 mb-6">
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-full ambient-shadow shrink-0">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-4xl icon-fill">menu_book</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-secondary tracking-widest uppercase mb-2">Key Publication</p>
          <h4 class="text-headline-sm font-headline-sm text-primary mb-3">Metabolic Syndrome in HIV Positive Patients</h4>
          <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-3">A pivotal research contribution addressing the intersection of infectious diseases and metabolic health, providing critical insights into patient management strategies in complex clinical scenarios.</p>
          <p class="text-caption font-caption text-on-surface-variant"><em>Indian Journal of Endocrinology and Metabolism (IJEM), 2013; 17:117-20</em></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal lift-card bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl p-8 border border-outline-variant/30 ambient-shadow flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start gap-6" data-delay="100">
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-full ambient-shadow shrink-0">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-4xl icon-fill">forum</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-secondary tracking-widest uppercase mb-2">Conferences &amp; CMEs</p>
          <h4 class="text-headline-sm font-headline-sm text-primary mb-3">Active Voice in National &amp; International Forums</h4>
          <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Has chaired and moderated sessions at state and national-level conferences. Regular participant and speaker at <strong>APICON, ACPCON, RSSDI, Diabetes India, ADA</strong>, and the <strong>CSI Conference</strong>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- =============== CTA =============== -->
    <section class="w-full bg-primary rounded-xl p-10 md:p-14 text-on-primary flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 mt-8 reveal reveal-scale relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_left,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-secondary-fixed to-transparent"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10">
        <h3 class="text-headline-md font-headline-md text-on-primary mb-3">Schedule a Consultation</h3>
        <p class="text-body-lg text-on-primary/80 max-w-xl">Whether for a routine check-up or a specialist second opinion, Dr. Tyagi is committed to evidence-based, patient-first care.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn-primary inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-secondary text-on-secondary-fixed rounded-DEFAULT text-label-md font-label-md relative z-10" href="/appointment">
        Book Appointment
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">arrow_forward</span>
      </a>
    </section>

  </main>
</Layout>
